            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nCan reproduce this. I vaguely remember that I *tried* to support all 'virtualedit' values (as there are tests for `virtualedit=block` and block mode) but maybe opted out to not support some edge cases as it would require some non-trivial code. I'll take a look.",
