        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This now should be fixed on latest `main`. And the fix proved to be half a line long with a pretty intuitive explanation (whether cursor position is a charwise edge should always be `false` in case of `virtualedit=all`, as there is no \"edge\" in this case).\r\n\r\nPlus there are now tests for all 'virtualedit' values in most common issue-inducing scenarios.\r\n\r\nThanks again for finding it!",
